<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Neil Danziger confirmed he upgraded Adtran Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Cited steep decline in company's shares as unwarranted, kept 12-month target price at 70.</p>
<p>-- Called concerns about new analog technology as a threat to Adtran's ISDN products &quot;overblown,&quot; also expressed optimism about success of Adtran's Total Reach product line.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 51 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
